## (b) PGD backtracking at a step whose square overflows: same one-dimensional problem scaled so that L_f = 5 α... start L0 = 0.4 L_f
# problem: X = ones(5,1), y = s·ones(5), α = 5e-100·(1e160/s)^2·... chosen so that α s² is fixed; L0 = 0.4 L_f = 0.4·5α
s=1e+100 α=1.00e+20 L_f=5.000e+20 kind=pgd: it1 #trials=2 trial L's=2.00e+20,5.00e+20  accepted_L=5.000e+20  |dx|=1.000e+100  (dx)^2 finite
